   $q$Which is the best objective summary of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Athletes who stay up late are making a foolish choice. Coaches should bench any player who does not get at least eight hours of sleep each night.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"includes-opinion"},{"text":"During deep sleep, the body releases growth hormone. This hormone helps rebuild tiny tears in the muscle fibers so that they come back stronger.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"Sleep helps athletes improve because it repairs muscles and strengthens new skills, while too little sleep leads to mistakes and injuries. Simple habits can help teens rest.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Teenagers should get eight to ten hours of sleep. Homework, early school start times and evening games can make getting enough sleep difficult.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Sleep helps athletes improve because it repairs muscles and strengthens new skills, while too little sleep leads to mistakes and injuries. Simple habits can help teens rest.$q$, $q$The second choice includes the benefits of sleep, the costs of missing it and the habits that help, without opinions. The first choice is accurate but leaves out why sleep matters at all.$q$, 'draft', 'a368281e-8bc7-5fda-9941-eb23355b155e')
